{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54268","headline":"示纸衣道者颂 · 本寂","name":"示纸衣道者颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"觉性圆明无相身，莫将知见妄疎亲。\n念异便於玄体昧，心差不与道爲（《正法眼藏》卷二作「相」）邻。\n情分万法沈前境，识鉴多端丧本真。\n如是（《僧宝传》卷一作「若向」）句中全晓会，了然无事昔时人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"本寂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54268.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54268","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}